# Manifold master at the merge of elalish/manifold#1887 (tie decisions in
# Boolean3 contradicted each other where a direction was exactly 0 and left
# flaps of overlapping triangles on coplanar unions). It also has #1898 (the
# broad phase reached less far than tie decisions), our earlier fixes #1884,
# #1885 and #1886, and #1877's tie tolerance; v3.5.4 has none of these. Back to
# a release tarball once one includes them.
